MATRIX: Breadth-first search on an adjacency garage. Node k lists its neighbours.
MATRIX: Queue and visited are garages. Order is the visitation garage.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE enqueue WITH queue AND value
  CASH OUT queue PLUS [value]
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE dequeue WITH queue
  CASH OUT CALL piece (queue, 1, CALL length WITH queue)
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE mark WITH seen AND index
  CASH OUT CALL put (seen, index, 1)
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE bfs WITH graph AND start
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH graph
  BUGATTI seen EQUALS []
  BUGATTI k EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE k IS LESS THAN n
    BUGATTI seen EQUALS seen PLUS [0]
    BUGATTI k EQUALS k PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  BUGATTI seen EQUALS CALL mark (seen, start)
  BUGATTI queue EQUALS [start]
  BUGATTI order EQUALS []
  GRIND WHILE CALL length (queue) IS GREATER THAN 0
    BUGATTI node EQUALS CALL at (queue, 0)
    BUGATTI queue EQUALS CALL dequeue WITH queue
    BUGATTI order EQUALS order PLUS [node]
    BUGATTI neighbours EQUALS CALL at (graph, node)
    BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
    GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN CALL length (neighbours)
      BUGATTI next EQUALS CALL at (neighbours, i)
      IF CALL at (seen, next) IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
        BUGATTI seen EQUALS CALL mark (seen, next)
        BUGATTI queue EQUALS CALL enqueue (queue, next)
      PERIOD
      BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
    STOP GRINDING
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT order
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI graph EQUALS [[1, 2], [3], [3], []]
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL bfs (graph, 0)

BACK TO THE MATRIX
